OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA chilly start tomorrow, with
OL,6,Fa light breeze. Dry with sunny spells
OL,7,Fduring the morning, but the afternoon
OL,8,Fsun will be dimmed by thickening cloud.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,11,Fwill be widely overcast with spots of
OL,12,Fdrizzle through the day. Becoming much
OL,13,Fbrighter on Tuesday after a morning of
OL,14,Frain and strong winds. Bright and
OL,15,Fbreezy on Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
